    "summary": "When a TYRANIDS MONSTER model in your army attacks, its Hit roll gets +1 while its unit is under Starting Strength, and its Wound roll also gets +1 once the unit has fallen Below Half-strength. Your TYRANIDS MONSTER units that are at full Starting Strength and not Battle-shocked also give their models +2 Objective Control.",
